i.github.com/users/mew2057","html_url":"https://github.com/mew2057","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mew2057/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mew2057/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mew2057/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mew2057/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mew2057/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mew2057/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mew2057/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mew2057/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mew2057/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-10T20:06:27Z","updated_at":"2025-02-10T20:06:27Z","body":"+1 for a similar issue on the following hardware:\n\n```\nGodot v4.4.beta3 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - \nVulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7216) - \n12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12600K (16 threads).\n```\n\nThere is no error message in the console or logs; I cleared drivers and reinstalled, but there was no change.\n\nNotably, it most frequently happens F6 invocations of component scenes.\n\n\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649118943/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659691915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102591#issuecomment-2659691915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102591","id":2659691915,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eh62L","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T15:53:35Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T15:53:35Z","body":"Thanks for the report. This kind of issue is difficult to debug for maintainers as it typically affects only specific user configurations of hardware/software which we can't easily reproduce.\n\nTo help us debug and possibly understand what causes the issue and how to fix it, here are some things you could do, though I'm fully aware they can be a big ask / time sink, especially if reproducing the bug leads to a desktop crash and the need to reboot.\n\n1. Identify which dev snapshot is the first one to trigger the issue. @Bound2bCoding mentions that you can reproduce this in all 4.4 versions, can you confirm this includes even 4.4.dev1, and that you do NOT reproduce it in 4.3.stable? This would mean that the regression happened between 4.3.stable and 4.4.dev1.\n2. One step further if either of you is able to [compile Godot from source](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/compiling/compiling_for_windows.html) could be to [bisect](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/workflow/bisecting_regressions.html) (a priori between 4.3.stable and 4.4.dev1 i.e. 28a72fa43 if step (1) above confirms that 4.4.dev1 is the first bad release.\n3. Another option which can be done additionally or instead of the above two is to compile Godot from source with debug symbols (`scons debug_symbols=yes`) and use a debugger (Visual Studio if compiling with MSVC, or GDB or LLDB if compiling with MinGW, for example from their VS Code plugins) to get a detailed crash backtrace.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659691915/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2664153872","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102591#issuecomment-2664153872","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102591","id":2664153872,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ey8MQ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-17T22:14:2